Structure point: Field x as integer. Field y as integer. End structure. Union value: Field whole as integer. Field fraction as decimal. End union. Declare p as structure point with values 3 followed by 4 done. Say Member x of p. Say Member y of p. Declare q as structure point with members y as 8 done. Say Member x of q. Say Member y of q. Declare a as array of integer with length 4 with values 1 followed by 2 done. Say Element at 0 in a. Say Element at 1 in a. Say Element at 2 in a. Say Element at 3 in a. Declare b as array of integer with length 4 with elements at 3 as 9 followed by at 1 as 7 done. Say Element at 0 in b. Say Element at 1 in b. Say Element at 2 in b. Say Element at 3 in b. Declare u as union value with members fraction as 2.5 done. Say Member fraction of u. Procedure local returns integer: Declare inside as structure point with members y as 6 done. Return Member x of inside plus Member y of inside. End procedure. Say Call local done.
